VALUES ('f6', 'kojo-asante', 'Kojo Asante', 'Asante Riverside', '/golden-acres/farmers/kojo-asante.jpg', NULL, 'Fruit and herb grower along the Central Region coast — pineapple, watermelon and ginger.', 'Kojo’s riverside farm near Winneba catches the coastal breeze that makes his pineapples extra sweet. He harvests fruit at peak ripeness rather than for shipping durability — possible only because Golden Acres gets it to your door within a day. His ginger and lemongrass are local-chef favourites.', '["Peak-ripeness harvest","River-fed irrigation","Agroforestry borders"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Central', 'Winneba', 'CW-228-5567', '{"lat":5.351,"lng":-0.623}'::jsonb, 70, 4.8, 134, 4.8, 134, 2021, 0.96, 'verified')
